              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "魏斯",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "唉，好啦，看來是瞞不過博士您。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "光靠信任是填不飽肚子的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "年長的領民",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "唔......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "魏斯",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "博士還真是不留情面啊。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "諸位，我確實還有話要說。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喀蘭貿易對內監管不嚴而致使各位失去寶貴的工作，完全是我們的失誤。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喀蘭貿易承諾會替各位保留原本的崗位，持續分發補償金，並儘快安排同等或更高待遇的工作機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "想必諸位也已經看到，這位博士明白各位真正需要的東西，他絕不會成為第二個諾希斯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他將為喀蘭貿易帶來真正服務於我們生活的技術，帶我們過上更好的生活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這，才是恩希歐迪斯老爺真正想傳達給各位的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "年輕的領民",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "太好了！我這就去告訴大夥！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "年長的領民",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好啊，真好。但是，年輕人啊，也切不可忘了耶拉岡德的教誨......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......呼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "切斯特",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "辛苦了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魏斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哪裡。為老爺傳信本就是我的職責。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這就是你說的幫忙。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "魏斯",
