          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "條件已經齊全，正如休露絲大人所料。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "魏斯會出現在這裡，恐怕也是恩希歐迪斯的保險措施。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但是，這種程度可不夠。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們幾個，待確認魏斯離去後，按休露絲大人原定計劃行事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "諾希斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你被人跟蹤了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "什麼！我完全沒有......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "諾希斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但對方只有一人，已經追著休露絲給你的人走了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "萬分慚愧，辜負了諾希斯大人的期望。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "諾希斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不，現在這樣也許才正好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......我已有心理準備，甘願成為棄子，聽憑大人差遣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "諾希斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我是一名研究者，莫希。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "諾希斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "棋子於我無益，我需要能夠與我共事的合作夥伴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "諾希斯",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "繼續執行計畫。無需多慮，菈塔托絲和休露絲抓不到你的把柄。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "莫希",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是。"
        },
